  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A fully enlisted Operator from Blacksteel, stationed at Rhodes Island as part of an exchange training program.",
        "zh": "黑钢的正式干员，作为双方交流项目的一环驻扎学习。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests on this Operator show clear outlines of internal organs, with no abnormal dark spots or shadows. No unusual traces of Originium particles present in the circulatory system, no signs of infection, confirming this operator as uninfected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nOperator Jessica showed no symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nOperator Jessica rarely comes into contact with Originium.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓清晰，未见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测未见异常，无矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为非矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】0%\n干员杰西卡没有被源石感染的迹象。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.12u/L\n干员杰西卡甚少接触源石。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A panicky Operator dispatched from Blacksteel, Jessica is a reliable, combat-effective asset and full-time Blacksteel mercenary. But she suffers from such crippling insecurity that Vanilla, a Blacksteel apprentice, seems more dependable in battle.",
        "zh": "总是慌慌张张的黑钢派遣干员。\n杰西卡虽然是黑钢的正式干员，本人的作战能力也值得信赖，却因为性格过于缺乏自信，而经常给人还不如香草这样的实习干员来得可靠的感觉。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Perhaps thanks to her timidity, Blacksteel executives would often scoop Jessica up and subject her to tests of new equipment and devices. Even after arriving at Rhodes Island, Operators would ask Jessica to demonstrate their new equipment before they'd be willing to use it. \nIn a way, it shows how naturally trustworthy Jessica is.",
        "zh": "或许是性格软弱的原因，在黑钢时就经常被各方抓去测试一些新型的协议和器械，来到罗德岛后，这一点也延续了下来。\n对新晋干员来说，她们在使用大部分器械前，都要先观看杰西卡的演示。\n某种意义上，这也是杰西卡值得信赖的表现。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A part of Jessica's insecurity stems from selective perception. \nIn actuality, Jessica has the skills to hold at least the middle rank in an organization of any scale. In her time with Blacksteel as well as Rhodes Island, there has never been a blemish on her record.",
        "zh": "杰西卡的缺乏自信，很大程度是因为来自参照物的选择。\n事实上，以杰西卡的能力，在任何一个小型组织中，都足以担当中坚。而即使在罗德岛或者黑钢之中，对杰西卡的评价，也从来没有低过。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
